纯黑白铅笔素描速写，铅笔排线阴影，手绘故事板质感，线条扎实，人物人体结构准确，古建筑结构写实，大量市井人群细节，不要卡通，不要水墨，不要上色。\n2. 构图：电影镜头语言，全景/中景/特写切换，符合影视叙事节奏。\n3. 人物：统一造型，前后镜头人物长相、服装保持一致，不能变形。\n4. 禁止：彩色，渲染图，3D，油画，二次元，模糊，崩坏人体。\n\n【故事背景脚本】\n（在这里填入你的故事，时代背景、人物、剧情）\n\n【需要生成的分镜总数】：__ 镜\n【画幅比例】：每一格画面 16:9\n【时代场景】：（例如：清末南方古县城集市，木构商铺，石牌坊，青石板街道）\n【主角人物设定】：（在这里写人物外貌、服饰）\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 519, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "title": "黑白铅笔素描故事板模板", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 23}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [808], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [510, 90], "pos": [4806.70361328125, 6118.431640625], "widgets_values": ["qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "id": 561, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors", "directory": "diffusion_models", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors"}], "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 24}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [792], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [413.00006103515625, 485.7544860839844], "pos": [7601.462890625, 6682.12451171875], "widgets_values": [0, "fixed", 25, 1, "euler", "